      "source_utf8": "SELECT 1;\nWITH RECURSIVE t(n) AS (SELECT 1 UNION ALL SELECT n + 1 FROM t WHERE n < 5) SEARCH DEPTH FIRST BY n SET ord CYCLE n SET is_cycle USING path SELECT * FROM t;\nWITH w AS MATERIALIZED (SELECT 1 AS a) SELECT a FROM w;\n",
